Package: robustDIF
Type: Package
Title: Differential item functioning using robust statistics
Version: 0.2.0.20260708
Author: Peter Halpin
Maintainer: Peter Halpin <peter.halpin@unc.edu>
Description: Functions for assessing differential item functioning (DIF) in item response theory (IRT) models using methods from robust statistics. This is the terminal archive build for the Halpin2024 JEBS paper revision and is not intended as the forward development branch for future CRAN releases.
